<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Page Not Found | Greenwood High School</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
  <style>
    body{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;background:#f8f9ff;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;margin:0}
    .error-wrap{text-align:center;padding:2rem}
    .error-code{font-size:8rem;font-weight:800;color:#1F1B76;line-height:1;opacity:.12;display:block}
    .error-icon{font-size:4rem;color:#1F1B76;margin-bottom:1.25rem;display:block}
    .error-wrap h1{font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#1F1B76;margin-bottom:.5rem}
    .error-wrap p{color:#6b7280;font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:400px}
    .error-links{display:flex;gap:.75rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="error-wrap">
  <span class="error-code">404</span>
  <i class="fas fa-map-signs error-icon"></i>
  <h1>Page Not Found</h1>
  <p>The page you're looking for doesn't exist or may have moved. Let's get you back on track.</p>
  <div class="error-links">
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Go to Home</a>
    <a href="/admissions" class="btn btn-outline">Admissions</a>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
